    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "This helps children to recognise common words on sight.",
          "zh": "这个帮助孩子们到认出常见的单词在……上视力。",
          "startMs": 18658,
          "endMs": 23266
        },
        {
          "en": "• Choose six simple words from the book (e.",
          "zh": "• 选择六简单的单词从这书 (呃。",
          "startMs": 23266,
          "endMs": 26869
        },
        {
          "en": "Mum, on, it).",
          "zh": "妈妈， 在……上， 它)。",
          "startMs": 26869,
          "endMs": 27958
        },
        {
          "en": "Copy each word twice on a sheet of paper, then cut them up into twelve individual cards.",
          "zh": "复制品每个单词两次在……上一个床单的纸， 然后切他们向上进入十二单独的卡片。",
          "startMs": 27958,
          "endMs": 35331
        },
        {
          "en": "• Place the word cards face down on the table.",
          "zh": "• 地方这单词卡片脸向下在……上这桌子。",
          "startMs": 35331,
          "endMs": 39185
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask the child to turn over two and read the words.",
          "zh": "问这孩子到转动在……上方二和读这单词。",
          "startMs": 39185,
          "endMs": 43375
        },
        {
          "en": "If they are the same, he/she keeps the words, if not, they are turned over and put back.",
          "zh": "如果他们是这同样的， 他/她保持这单词， 如果不， 他们是转动在……上方和放回来。",
          "startMs": 43375,
          "endMs": 50748
        },
        {
          "en": "• Take turns to turn over and read two words until all the cards have been picked up.",
          "zh": "• 拿转动到转动在……上方和读二单词直到全部这卡片有是挑选向上。",
          "startMs": 50748,
          "endMs": 57870
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 57870,
          "endMs": 62645
        },
        {
          "en": "• Count the number of times 'said' appears in the story.",
          "zh": "• 数数这数字的时间 '说' 出现在……里这故事。",
          "startMs": 62645,
          "endMs": 67337
        },
        {
          "en": "Make a Lucky Dip by wrapping some small toys in old wrapping paper.",
          "zh": "做一个幸运的浸由包装纸一些小的玩具在……里旧的包装纸纸。",
          "startMs": 67337,
          "endMs": 72951
        },
        {
          "en": "Put them in a box.",
          "zh": "放他们在……里一个盒子。",
          "startMs": 72951,
          "endMs": 74459
        },
        {
          "en": "Take turns to pay money (1p or 2p) to have a Lucky Dip and find a toy.",
          "zh": "拿转动到付钱钱 (1谨言慎行或者 2谨言慎行) 到有一个幸运的浸和找到一个玩具。",
          "startMs": 74459,
          "endMs": 80324
        }
      ],
